#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"User tokens allow to predefine information like the email address, subject, "
"and text directly in the document without having to manually open PDFCreator "
"settings for each conversion."
msgstr ""
"Tokeny používateľa umožňujú definovať informácie ako e-mailové adresy, "
"predmet, text a ďalšie priamo z dokumentu bez manuálneho otvorenia nastavení "
"PDFCreator pre každý jeden prevod."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "Need help?"
msgstr "Potrebujete pomoc?"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"Looking for help with a specific feature or setting? Simply hit the F1 "
"button anywhere in PDFCreator and the related help page will open "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Hľadáte pomoc s určitou funkciou alebo nastavením? Jednoducho stlačte "
"tlačidlo F1 kdekoľvek v programe PDFCreator a príslušná stránka nápovede sa "
"automaticky otvorí."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "PDFCreator Online"
msgstr "PDFCreator Online"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"Have you tried PDFCreator Online? It lets you convert and merge PDFs quickly "
"and easily in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Už ste vyskúšali PDFCreator Online? Umožňuje prevod a spájanie PDF súborov "
"rýchlejšie a jednoduchšie priamo z vášho prehliadača."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "Automatic Saving"
msgstr "Automatické ukladanie"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"Enable automatic mode and skip the interaction with PDFCreator. With a few "
"configurations you will be able to create and save your PDFs to your "
"preferred folder by simply printing directly from your document."
msgstr ""
"Povolením preskočíte interakciu s programom PDFCreator. S miernym upravením "
"nastavení budete môcť vytvárať a ukladať vaše PDF súbory jednoduchšie a "
"priamo z vášho dokumentu."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "Send PDFs \"without\" saving"
msgstr "Poslať PDF súbory „bez\" ukladania"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"All you want to do is send your PDF documents by email, ftp or similar and "
"not bother where to save them? PDFCreator has a feature that allows you to "
"save files only temporarily before they automatically get deleted."
msgstr ""
"Chcete odosielať vaše PDF dokumenty e-mailom, na FTP alebo podobne bez "
"starosti kam ste ich uložili? PDFCreator má funkciu, ktorá ukladá súbory iba "
"do dočasného priečinku predtým ako sú automaticky vymazané."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "Your individual workflow"
msgstr "Váš individuálny pracovný plán"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"When activating the workflow editor you can choose the actions that fit best "
"to your requirements and adjust their order according to your individual "
"workflow."
msgstr ""

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Authenticate with Dropbox"
msgid "Send large PDFs with Dropbox"
msgstr "Overenie v službe Dropbox"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"PDFCreator lets you upload your files directly to Dropbox, where you can "
"save them or share them via a link."
msgstr ""
"PDFCreator vám umožní nahrať vaše súbory priamo na Dropbox, kde ich môžete "
"uložiť a zdielať prostredníctvom odkazu."

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid "Forward to another profile"
msgstr "Preposlať do iného profilu"

#: pdfforge.PDFCreator.UI.Presentation.Banner.FrequentTipsTranslation
msgid ""
"PDFCreator can automatically forward the original document to another "
"profile, for example to convert to another format."
msgstr ""
"PDFCreator dokáže automaticky previesť originálny dokument do iného profilu, "
"napríklad vykonať prevod do iného formátu."

